partment is having four faculty members with two PhD. holders. The department runs a full time BA major Program designed and developed by Dibrugarh University to which this institution had been affiliated.\nThe department assesses the learning levels of the students and organizes special Programmes for advanced learners and slow learners. (2.2.1)\nThe Department of Economics has been organizing special progrmmes for advanced learners and slow learners as given below:\nWe have been taking special classes over and above the allotted classes for the advanced as well as slow learners from time to time after verifying their ability, adaptability etc. to the subject taught. The task of mentorship has been done by each permanent faculty member by making separate groups of students from each Semester. Guest lectures have been arranged from renowned academics and industry experts to deliver lectures on specialized topics relevant for today. Debates and competitions have been conducted to showcase skills of students. For Slow Learners, remedial classes have been taken to provide additional support to them.\n– Established in: 1963\n– Primary Objective: To provide advanced studies and career opportunities in discipline.\nVision and Mission\n– Aims to contribute to the global community by addressing social/cultural/scientific needs.\n– Strives to develop students into responsible professionals and enrich their lives.\nMentoring them to provide guidance and support in every step of the learning process.\nFaculty Profile\nFaculty\nDr. Kamalendu Saikia, M.A., Ph.D.,\nAssociate Professor\nkamalendu@dibrucollege.edu.in\nMr. Prasanta Kr. Borah\nAssociate Professor\nprasanta@dibrucollege.edu.in\nDr. Jayanta Saud, PhD (HoD)\nAssociate Professor\njsaud21@gmail.com\nMs. Juri Phukan, M.A.  SET, M.Phil.\nAssistant Professor\njuriphukan89@gmail.com\nCourses and Syllabus\nCourses and Syllabus\nThe Department of Economics, Dibru College is currently offering Four Year Undergraduate Programme in Economics (B.A. in Economics) under NEP-2020. The syllabus can easily be downloaded from Dibrugarh University Website.\nLink Of the syllabus:\nClick To Download\nDepartmental Activities\nDepartmental Activities\nDepartmental Educational Tour\nOctober 30, 2025\nA Talk on Entrepreneurship\nOctober 30, 2025\nA Special Talk on Political Institutions and Functioning of the State\nOctober 30, 2025\nA special Talk on Democracy and Economic Development\nOctober 30, 2025\nPublications\nPublications\nDEPARTMENT PROFILE\nQuick Location\nIGNOU\nUniversity Grant Commission\nGetting to NAAC\nDirectorate Of Higher Education\nGuwahati University\nDibrugarh University\nImportant Pages\nAlumni Association\nParent Association\nIQAC\nDHE Updates\nRUSA\nGallery\nDownloads\nContact Us\nDibru College,\nDibrugarhAssam 786003\nPhone – 0373-2311328\ndibru.college@rediffmail.com\nWebsite Visitor\n👥\nWEBSITE VISITORS\n0\nThank you for visiting\n© 2026 Dibru College | All Rights Reserved | Designed by AIO Digital Solutions\nTeachers Login\nStudent Login\nStudent Admission", "links": [{"label": "Teachers Login", "url": "https://dibrucollege.online/site/login"}, {"label": "Student Login", "url": "https://dibrucollege.online/site/userlogin"}, {"label": "Student Admission", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/online-admission/"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/department-of-economics/"}, {"label": "Home", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/"}, {"label": "About", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/about/"}, {"label": "College Profile", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/college-profile/"}, {"label": "VISION & MISSION", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/vision-mission/"}, {"label": "Infrastructure", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/department-of-economics/"}, {"label": "Sports Facilities", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/sports-facilities/"}, {"label": "Girls’ Common room", "url": "https://dibrucollege.edu.in/girls-